WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
A phone falls four point nine t squared metres.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.200
How fast at two seconds?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.700
Two to three: twenty-four point five.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.760
Two to two point one: twenty point zero nine.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.700
Two to two point zero one: nineteen point six four nine.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.230
Zoom in: the curve looks straight.

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:20.200
Its slope is nineteen point six metres per second.

